WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.670
If your prep is ClenPIQ, this video will walk you through exactly how to

2
00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:04.400
take it.

3
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:09.820
Just follow along step by step. Your ClenPIQ prep comes as two small, ready-to-drink

4
00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:10.720
bottles.

5
00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:15.760
You'll drink each bottle straight. The day before your colonoscopy,

6
00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:19.980
between 5 and 9 PM, you'll drink your first bottle of ClenPIQ right from the

7
00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:20.320
bottle.

8
00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:25.060
After you finish it, drink 5 cups of clear liquid over the next 3 to

9
00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:25.760
5 hours.

10
00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:32.320
Remember, no red, orange, blue, or purple liquids. For your second dose, 6

11
00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:33.200
hours before your

12
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:37.720
procedure time, drink your second bottle of ClenPIQ. After finishing it,

13
00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:38.800
drink 8 ounces of

14
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:45.700
clear liquid every 15 minutes. This totals 32 ounces over 1 hour. If your

15
00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:46.400
procedure is

16
00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:49.780
scheduled for early morning, you will need to get up during the night to take

17
00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:50.800
this second dose.

18
00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:55.500
The correct timing of this dose is essential to an effective preparation. Do

19
00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:56.800
not have any

20
00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:01.350
liquids at all within 4 hours of your procedure. This part is really

21
00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:02.320
important.

22
00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:06.160
You must drink all of the prep solution as directed, even if you're already

23
00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:07.200
passing clear liquid.

24
00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:12.020
I know it can feel like enough, but finishing the entire dose is what gives us

25
00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:12.560
the clearest

26
00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:16.780
view during your procedure. If the prep isn't completed as directed, we may

27
00:01:16.780 --> 00:01:17.920
need to reschedule,

28
00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:21.460
and neither of us wants that. Drink as many clear liquids as possible

29
00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:22.640
throughout the process.

30
00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:27.160
Hydration is important, and it's actually part of the prep. Make sure to hydrate

31
00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:28.000
before you take

32
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.650
the prep while you're taking the prep, but nothing after your second dose. If

33
00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:32.960
you experience any

34
00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:37.240
discomfort from frequent trips to the bathroom, applying a petroleum-based ointment

35
00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:38.160
or diaper rash

36
00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:43.290
cream can really help. That's it. You've got this. Follow the timing, finish

37
00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:44.480
the full dose, and stay

38
00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:49.220
hydrated. If you have any questions at all, don't hesitate to call our office.

39
00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:51.280
We're here to help.
